<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-14T06:20:04.354Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:20:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan is confronting renewed cross-border tension as it blames Taliban fighters in Afghanistan for attacks while the Taliban rejects the claims and reports a surge in arrests after a Panjshir blast. The EU has launched a €5 million border-security project in Pakistan and is discussing labour mobility, while Pakistan has tested an extended-range Fatah‑2 hypersonic ballistic missile. Simultaneously, large caches of weapons and explosives have been seized near the India-Pakistan border in Rajasthan, and Pakistan has reaffirmed its defence commitment to Saudi Arabia amid Houthi attacks. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/asia/europe-taliban-deportations-migrants.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxPV1FwWDREQXFPSnhNZEVwcVV2NVBXYUFmenVMZjZoejFHMEtwakdPckd5anJQSkV0dmxxRkVLZDgxMFNPMjg0aHgyY1VKdnR0ZGNlZW1lWWVCQkR6MkJQUWpMUjNWSU00Q05QVWlqOFNFWXJsNW1yZk9KQ3hjUERWUDB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBGX0hVRWNRY3hjQjA2SjVkdFdpR2dsTGJKQVdGNmhyd2hUNWZld2JCczlfemZndWFTbFFxSzA1REk3VldEM0dOVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE9GbkFVVzdaZnVWUVppdGFoclNLNkpteG5wS0piYzJPVzJHMjN2SnlBN1BCcExydkVzNmY0YnZsazBBR2FfZ3ZkYWZoMGZLcTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;thekabultribune.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPRXFJcHVuSUZuVzVBdWY3VGkxSVZUWlhxcGg2SENpdHltSno5R0J2TDY4dUk0d2owYXFZeEpLV21wcGRiaERjTXZWa3Q4aDVKZHpDQU9PNlIwUEMtdlBkbFhWdjhIMkYwV1dqMVpQdGtta0FEeXVUa0NBMWJpWWM1MkNjWC1CbXhjQ1JfWlJONThaZlZ5LU03bU